## ✅ IAM Policy for Lambda
Attach this inline policy to the Lambda execution role:
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "ses:SendEmail",
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}
```
